[00:00.00] 作词 : Jack Antonoff/John Ryan/Sabrina Carpenter/Amy Allen
[00:00.00][by:伤感咩吖]
[00:00.17] 作曲 : Jack Antonoff/John Ryan/Sabrina Carpenter/Amy Allen
[00:00.34] Love when happy hour comes at 10 a.m. o'clock on a Tuesday
[00:00.34]周二上午十点的欢乐时光 我爱惨了
[00:07.45] Guess a broken heart doesn't care that I just woke up
[00:07.45]想必一颗破碎的心 才不管我是否刚睡醒
[00:14.70] Got a soft spot for a bev and a boy that's fruity
[00:14.70]总会对甜酒和有趣的男孩心软
[00:19.07] Can't lie, whole week's been tough
[00:19.07]坦白说 整整一周都备受煎熬
[00:22.08] No party invitations, not going to the club
[00:22.08]没有派对邀约 也没去夜店嗨
[00:24.71]
[00:25.71] I'm just drinking to call someone
[00:25.71]我不过是借酒意打个电话
[00:29.41] Ain't nobody safe when I'm a little bit drunk
[00:29.41]一旦我微醺上头 谁都别想安生
[00:33.04] Could be John or Larry, gosh, who's to say?
[00:33.04]可能要找的是约翰 或着拉里 天晓得呢
[00:36.26] Or the one that rhymes with "villain" if I'm feeling that way
[00:36.26]或着在兴头上的话 我会打给那个跟“恶棍”谐音的混蛋
[00:39.92] Oh, I'm just drinking to call someone
[00:39.92]噢 我只是借酒壮胆 好打给某个人
[00:43.64] A girl who knows her liquor is a girl who's been dumped
[00:43.64]一个对酒了如指掌的女孩 往往也是被甩的那个
[00:47.52] Sippin' on my go go juice, I can't be blamed
[00:47.52]小酌着我的快活神仙水 这可怪不了我
[00:50.88] Some good old fashioned fun sure numbs the pain
[00:50.88]一些老派的乐子 确实能麻痹伤痛
[00:53.83]
[00:55.83] Ring, ring, ring, yeah, it's super important (How many shots in an ounce?)
